    {
      "id": "2dd9844b-ee7a-4b73-a661-b4caf3adfa70",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "cadd3afe-b29a-4636-a907-1b8c6387263b",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib: The west\nsalon is called\nthe Winter Room\nbecause winter\nenters",
                "it. I used to call\nthat seasonal\nairflow. Now I am\ncalling a roofer.",
                "The junction door\nis behind the\nlisting stand, and\nthe easement is",
                "in the disclosure."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c34dab20-91f5-44f5-a66a-b641f9202cd3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bffae052-7cd3-4485-aeee-f18c51d5f5cf",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The listing plan\nshows the service\ndoor south, the\nguest bedroom",
                "north, and the\nkitchen east. A\nrepair crew can\ncarry tools from\nthe",
                "south door\nstraight to the\njunction along the\nservice hall. A",
                "proposed shortcut\ncrosses the\nbedroom. Nib\npoints to the\neasement:",
                "permission to\nrepair pipes does\nnot grant whatever\nroute is",
                "shortest. A tenant\nhas asked that\nworkers stop\ntreating her\ncarpet",
                "as public\ninfrastructure."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "facbaba7-8232-4c07-ad3c-39ae14480ae0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "0ee57082-fb42-4903-ab16-32b661e957ce",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The easement\npermits city\nworkers to cross\nthe service hall\nfor pipe",
                "repairs. It does\nnot grant public\nuse of bedrooms or\nkitchen. The",
                "lodge owner keeps\nthose rooms. Nib\nreads the boundary\naloud,",
                "unusually free of\ntheatrical\ngestures."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5887bb2c-3c6c-48b9-a007-a3058a09f057",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "cd8fbc28-c087-46c7-adb6-97c1059ef5df",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which space does\nthe easement\nauthorize the\nrepair crew to\nuse?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2b10b676-27cd-4e06-a6de-d6bb2296593e",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bba65328-cf04-4f4f-a6d9-4212b47eb24d",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which instruction\nbelongs in the\ncrew access\nnotice? Keep the",
                "service right\neffective without\nturning it into a\nclaim over private",
                "rooms. The tenant\nwill receive the\nsame notice as the\nbuilders. Nib",
                "wants her to know\nexactly where\nstrangers will\nwalk, not merely\nbe",
                "reassured that\neveryone means\nwell and carries\nclean boots."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cd900b41-f9a5-4326-ad3d-eeb4dfd6313c",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5c3fe754-5898-417d-aef3-5eaa7fc595e7",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Four branches feed\ninto one iron\nthroat. A polished\nbrass wheel",
                "closes all four\ntogether. Dot sees\nfresh grease on\nthe wheel.",
                "Someone has cared\nfor it. Someone\nhas also made\nevery branch\ndepend",
                "on a single moving\npiece."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
